1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Market updates usually mean staring at a terminal,
a chart, a few indicators.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
But when your hands are busy — driving or working —
those ten minutes are simply lost.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:32,000
So I built an agent that only needs your voice.
I send a voice message to Telegram, and it does the rest.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Let me show you.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
[voice message]
"What is Bitcoin doing on the 4-hour chart?"

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:54,000
First, speech recognition:
AssemblyAI transcribes the note and detects the language automatically.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Then the model decides which data it needs:
price, RSI, moving average, Bollinger Bands.

8
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The answer comes back as voice — you can listen
without looking at the screen — and as text with the details.

9
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Now a chart. I am not telling it which tool to call —
the model decides that by itself.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Candles, SMA20, Bollinger Bands and an RSI panel —
built on demand, in the moment.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:53,000
One more tool: the market Fear and Greed index.

12
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Also answered by voice, also with the numbers in writing.

13
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:20,000
A spoken question, a spoken answer, plus a chart.
The stack: AssemblyAI, LLM tool calling, Telegram.

14
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
The code is open source — link in the description. Thank you.
